        "evidence": "[ 1 ] [ 2 ] [ 3 ] [ 4 ] ↑ 1.0 1.1 Miller PD, et al. \"Effect of abaloparatide vs placebo on new vertebral fractures in postmenopausal women with osteoporosis: ACTIVE trial.\" JAMA . 2016;316(7):722-733. ↑ 2.0 2.1 Bone HG, et al. \"ACTIVExtend: 24 months of alendronate after 18 months of abaloparatide or placebo for postmenopausal osteoporosis.\" J Clin Endocrinol Metab . 2018;103(8):2949-2957. ↑ 3.0 3.1 Hattersley G, et al. \"Binding selectivity of abaloparatide for PTH-type-1-receptor conformations and effects on downstream signaling.\" Endocrinology . 2016;157(1):141-9. ↑ Tymlos (abaloparatide) Prescribing Information. Radius Health / Guidon Healthcare. P Pep Dex Track saturation levels, half-life decay curves, and injection schedules for 50+ peptides. AI coaching, blood work correlation, and side effect monitoring. Includes MacroDex (4.39M foods) & FitDex (1,356 exercises).",
        "halfLife": "",
