        "evidence": "Strong human evidence UK prescription-only medicine. Synacthen (synthetic ACTH analogue) is used by NHS endocrinology for adrenal-function testing. Prohibited at all times under WADA S2. Human evidence grade A, Strong human evidence. Citation quality grade A, Strong human evidence.",
