        "evidence": "Limited human evidence Not a licensed UK medicine. A modified fragment of growth hormone marketed for fat loss. Earlier obesity development did not produce a licensed product; human evidence for normal adults is limited. Captured by WADA prohibited classes for growth-related peptides. Human evidence grade E, Theoretical / insufficient. Citation quality grade C, Limited human evidence.",
