        "evidence": "[ 1 ] [ 2 ] [ 3 ] [ 4 ] ↑ 1.0 1.1 Said SI, Mutt V. \"Polypeptide with Broad Biological Activity: Isolation from Small Intestine.\" Science . 1970;169:1217-1218. ↑ 2.0 2.1 Youssef JG, et al. \"Treatment of COVID-19 Patients with Aviptadil (Synthetic Human VIP) in a Non-Randomized Open-Label Study.\" Open Forum Infect Dis . 2020;7(S1):S783. ↑ 3.0 3.1 Jihad G Youssef, et al. \"Intravenous Aviptadil and Remdesivir for Treatment of COVID-19-Associated Hypoxemic Respiratory Failure: The TESICO Randomized Clinical Trial.\" JAMA . 2023;329:1005-1015. ↑ Dey A, et al. \"Vasoactive Intestinal Peptide (VIP) and Pituitary Adenylate Cyclase-Activating Peptide (PACAP) in Respiratory Diseases.\" J Neuroimmunol . 2021;355:577556. P Pep Dex Track saturation levels, half-life decay curves, and injection schedules for 50+ peptides. AI coaching, blood work correlation, and side effect monitoring. Includes MacroDex (4.39M foods) & FitDex (1,356 exercises).",
