        "mechanism": "Cardiac Gene Regulation : Proposed to bind DNA regulatory sequences in cardiomyocytes → upregulates genes for myosin heavy chain, troponin, and other contractile proteins Anti-Apoptotic : Activates Bcl-2 and suppresses Bax/caspase pathways → protects cardiomyocytes from programmed cell death Anti-Fibrotic : May reduce cardiac fibroblast activation and collagen deposition → limits age-related fibrosis Mitochondrial Support : Restores mitochondrial gene expression in aging cardiomyocytes → improved ATP production and reduced ROS Ischemic Preconditioning : May enhance endogenous cardioprotective pathways → improved resistance to ischemia-reperfusion injury Vascular Repair : Promotes endothelial function and angiogenesis in cardiac tissue",
