          "Published December 7, 2025 Updated August 30, 2026 Quick Brief Discover the best injection sites for CJC-1295 and Ipamorelin. Our comprehensive guide covers optimal locations, step-by-step injection instructions, dosage timing, and safety tips for maximum results.",
          "Before we dive into the specific locations, it is essential to understand how these peptides are delivered. CJC-1295 and Ipamorelin are administered via subcutaneous injection .",
