          "Wash specific hands thoroughly with soap and water. Clean the vial stopper with an alcohol swab and let it dry. Draw air into your syringe equivalent to your dosage amount. Inject the air into the vial to equalize pressure. Turn the vial upside down and slowly draw back the plunger to your prescribed mark.",
          "Select your site (e.g., lower left abdomen). Clean the skin with a fresh alcohol pad. wiping in a circular motion. Let it dry. This is crucial-injecting through wet alcohol causes that \"stinging\" sensation. Do not blow on it; let it air dry for 10-20 seconds.",
          "Pinch the skin: With your non-dominant hand, gently pinch a fold of skin and fat. This pulls the fatty tissue away from the muscle below. Insert the needle: Hold the syringe like a dart. Insert the needle quickly and firmly into the pinched skin at a 45 to 90-degree angle .",
