        "evidence": "Animal/cell evidence only Not a licensed UK medicine. The long-acting (1-2 week half-life) variant of CJC-1295, with original pharmaceutical development discontinued. Prohibited at all times under WADA S2. Human evidence grade D, Animal/cell evidence only. Citation quality grade C, Limited human evidence.",
