        "lastReviewed": "2026-09-17",
        "summary": "From Wikipep - The Peptide Encyclopedia Cosmetic Peptides in Skincare is a comprehensive guide to the peptide ingredients used in anti-aging skincare, dermatological treatments, and cosmeceutical formulations. Cosmetic peptides are short-chain amino acid sequences designed to penetrate the stratum corneum and modulate specific biological processes in the skin - from collagen synthesis to neuromuscular signaling to melanin production. This article serves as a hub linking to all cosmetic peptide articles on WikiPep. 📦 Group BuyKits Community-powered research peptide sourcing COA Every Batch 14-Day Free Trial No CC Required Retatrutide 20mg Kit of 10 vials $118 $11.80/vial Tirzepatide 30mg Kit of 10 vials $100 $10/vial KLOW Blend 80mg Kit of 10 vials $155 $15.50/vial Tesamorelin 10mg Kit of 10 vials $160 $16/vial Direct manufacturer pricing &bull; Third-party COA testing &bull; $10/mo after trial Try Free for 14 Days →",
