        "evidence": "Animal/cell evidence only Endogenous family of antimicrobial peptides. Synthetic defensin analogues are in early development; not currently a licensed UK medicine for any indication. Human evidence grade E, Theoretical / insufficient. Citation quality grade C, Limited human evidence.",
