        "evidence": "Gold standard for studying μ-opioid receptor pharmacology Template for design of potent μ-selective analgesic peptides Tool for understanding D-amino acid function in naturally occurring peptides Evolutionary biology - frog skin chemical ecology Structure-activity relationship studies for opioid drug design 🧪 Vial Dex The World's Most Advanced Peptide Calculator 100% FREE 💧 Reconstitution Vial + BAC water mixing 📉 Dose & Units Syringe units to draw 🔀 Blend Multi-peptide vial ratios 📚 Stack Protocol Multi-vial dose planning 💨 Nasal Spray Spray bottle concentrations 50+ Peptides 7 Calculators 0 Signup Required Peptide: Dermorphin Open Free Calculator → [ 1 ] [ 2 ] [ 3 ] ↑ 1.0 1.1 Montecucchi PC, et al. \"Amino acid composition and sequence of dermorphin, a novel opiate-like peptide from the skin of Phyllomedusa sauvagei.\" Int J Pept Protein Res . 1981;17:275-283. ↑ 2.0 2.1 Negri L, et al. \"Dermorphin and deltorphin glycosylated analogs: structure-activity relationships.\" J Pharmacol Exp Ther . 1999;289:353-360. ↑ 3.0 3.1 New York Times.",
