          "But these were short-term observations, not long-term safety evaluations.",
          "The FDA has stated it \"has not identified any human exposure data\" for Dihexa.",
          "No controlled human safety studies have been published.",
          "Theoretical Concerns Cancer risk.",
          "The HGF/c-Met pathway is a recognized oncogenic signaling axis .",
