          "Anxiety and nervousness - a subset of subjects report increased anxiety, social anxiety, or a jittery nervous quality particularly in the first weeks of a cycle; likely related to increased synaptic density and associated heightened sensory and cognitive processing; tends to attenuate as the cycle progresses if the.",
