          "HGF/c-Met signaling is implicated in tumor growth and metastasis in oncology research; individuals with a strong family history of HGF-pathway cancers should discuss this pathway with a physician before use.",
          "All safety information comes from rodent behavioral studies; no human trials of dihexa itself have been completed.",
