          "Efocipegtrutide (HM15211, \"LAPS Triple Agonist\") is an investigational long-acting peptide that simultaneously activates the GLP-1, GIP, and glucagon receptors, engineered by Hanmi Pharmaceutical using its LAPScovery platform, which conjugates the active peptide to a human IgG4-derived aglycosylated Fc fragment"
