        "evidence": "Animal/cell evidence only Not a licensed UK medicine. Myostatin inhibitor with research interest in muscular dystrophy and other muscle-wasting conditions. Prohibited at all times under WADA S1.2 (other anabolic agents). Some commercial preparations are gene-therapy constructs, not peptides - verify what's actually being sold. Human evidence grade E, Theoretical / insufficient. Citation quality grade C, Limited human evidence.",
