        "evidence": "Limited human evidence Naturally occurring tripeptide-copper complex. Topical cosmetic formulations are regulated under UK cosmetics legislation; injectable forms are research-only and unlicensed. Genuine cosmetic evidence exists for topical skin and hair endpoints; injectable claims should be assessed separately. Human evidence grade C, Limited human evidence. Citation quality grade B, Moderate human evidence.",
