          "Lyophilized Powder : - Room temperature: Stable for 6-12 months - Refrigerated (2-8°C): Stable for 2+ years - Protect from light and moisture Reconstituted Solution : - Refrigerate at 2-8°C immediately after mixing - Use within 14-21 days for optimal potency - Protect from light and temperature fluctuations",
