        "lastReviewed": "2026-09-17",
        "summary": "Published March 4, 2026 Updated August 30, 2026 Quick Brief Comparing the top GH-stimulating peptides in 2026: Sermorelin, Ipamorelin, CJC-1295, Tesamorelin, and Hexarelin - ranked by potency, safety, and best use case. Growth Hormone Peptides Ranked: Sermorelin vs Ipamorelin vs CJC-1295 vs Tesamorelin vs Hexarelin (2026) Procurement CJC-1295 No DAC 5mg + Ipamorelin 5mg (FIT Stack 10mg) Ships from USA $35.00 $70.00 Get FIT Stack -",
