        "evidence": "Published March 20, 2026 Updated August 30, 2026 Quick Brief Ipamorelin is one of the cleanest growth hormone secretagogues available - targeted fat loss, muscle recovery, better sleep, and none of the cortisol or hunger spikes that older GHRPs cause. Here's what the research and real-world use actually show. Ipamorelin Benefits: What This GH Peptide Actually Does Procurement CJC-1295 No DAC 5mg + Ipamorelin 5mg (FIT Stack 10mg) Ships from USA $35.00 $70.00 Get FIT Stack - The ipamorelin benefits documented across research and user experience are wide-ranging, which is why this peptide attracts interest from athletes, people focused on body composition, and those interested in longevity and aging. 🔥 For maximizing the sleep and recovery benefits and overnight recovery, dosing 30-60 minutes before bed is the most common approach. This times the GH pulse with your natural nocturnal GH peak and slow-wave sleep window. Keep the dose away from any large meals, especially carbohydrate-heavy ones, to avoid insulin interference. View All sexual health comparisons",
        "halfLife": "",
        "halfLifeContext": "",
