        "lastReviewed": "2026-09-17",
        "summary": "The Ipamorelin + Tesamorelin blend is an 18mg co-lyophilized advanced GH axis stimulation and visceral fat reduction stack (12mg Tesamorelin / 6mg Ipamorelin) - a 2:1 Tesamorelin-dominant ratio reflecting Tesamorelin's outsized role as the primary therapeutic driver in this combination. Tesamorelin is a synthetic analog of growth hormone-releasing hormone (GHRH) consisting of the full 44-amino acid GHRH(1-44) sequence with a trans-3-hexenoic acid modification at the N-terminus that dramatically increases plasma stability versus native GHRH (half-life approximately 30 minutes versus native GHRH's 7 minutes); it acts directly on GHRH receptors (GHRHR) in the anterior pituitary somatotroph cells to stimulate pulsatile growth hormone (GH) secretion and downstream hepatic IGF-1 production.",
        "evidence": "Peptide University labels its records as aggregated from empirical research and anecdotal community data. This record is retained as supplied and is not upgraded to clinical evidence.",
        "halfLife": "",
