        "summary": "A bispecific peptide-antibody conjugate combining GLP-1 receptor agonism with GIP receptor antagonism. Unique mechanism opposite to tirzepatide. The published Phase 2 trial (NCT05669599) showed up to ~16% weight loss at 52 weeks with once-monthly dosing. MARITIME Phase 3 program ongoing.",
