        "summary": "An oral macrocyclic peptide PCSK9 inhibitor in Phase 3 development by Merck. Pivotal Phase 3 LDL-C trials are now published, and the CORALreef Outcomes cardiovascular trial (~14,500 participants) is ongoing. Phase 2 data showed greater than 60% LDL-C reduction. Would be the first oral peptide-based PCSK9 drug if approved.",
