          "Insomnia - if administered in the afternoon or evening; sirtuin activation and mitochondrial biogenesis stimulation creates a wakefulness effect; mandatory morning dosing protocol exists specifically to prevent this.",
          "Mild anxiety or jitteriness - reported in sensitive subjects at higher doses; related to CNS NAD+ restoration and noradrenergic pathway activation.",
          "Potential CD38 activation - at sustained high NAD+ concentrations, CD38 may be upregulated as a homeostatic counter-regulation; this can paradoxically increase NAD+ consumption; not well characterized at subcutaneous doses."
