        "evidence": "DSM SYN-COLL Study : 4% cream applied twice daily × 84 days → 35% reduction in wrinkle depth, 25% improvement in skin firmness (N=22, double-blind) In Vitro : Stimulated collagen synthesis in human dermal fibroblasts by 119% at 3ppm concentration Comparison to Retinol : Similar efficacy to 0.05% retinol for wrinkle reduction without irritation or photosensitivity 🧪 Vial Dex The World's Most Advanced Peptide Calculator 100% FREE 💧 Reconstitution Vial + BAC water mixing 📉 Dose & Units Syringe units to draw 🔀 Blend Multi-peptide vial ratios 📚 Stack Protocol Multi-vial dose planning 💨 Nasal Spray Spray bottle concentrations 50+ Peptides 7 Calculators 0 Signup Required Peptide: Palmitoyl Tripeptide-5 Open Free Calculator → [ 1 ] [ 2 ] [ 3 ] [ 4 ] ↑ 1.0 1.1 Robinson LR, et al. \"Topical Palmitoyl Pentapeptide Provides Improvement in Photoaged Human Facial Skin.\" Int J Cosmet Sci . 2005;27:155-160. ↑ 2.0 2.1 Lintner K, et al. \"Biologically Active Peptides in Cosmetology.\" Cosmet Toilet . 2008;123:72-80. ↑ 3.0 3.1 DSM Technical Data Sheet: SYN-COLL (Palmitoyl Tripeptide-5).",
