        "evidence": "[ 1 ] [ 2 ] [ 3 ] [ 4 ] ↑ 1.0 1.1 Tatemoto K et al. (1986). \"Pancreastatin, a novel pancreatic peptide that inhibits insulin secretion.\" Nature . 324(6096):476-8. ↑ 2.0 2.1 O'Connor DT et al. (2005). \"Pancreastatin: multiple actions, multiple mechanisms.\" Regul Pept . 125(1-3):17-22. ↑ 3.0 3.1 Gayen JR et al. (2009). \"A novel pathway of insulin sensitivity in chromogranin A null mice.\" J Biol Chem . 284(42):28498-509. ↑ Bandyopadhyay GK et al. (2015). \"Pancreastatin-dependent inflammatory signaling mediates obesity-associated insulin resistance.\" Diabetes . 64(1):104-16. P Pep Dex Track saturation levels, half-life decay curves, and injection schedules for 50+ peptides. AI coaching, blood work correlation, and side effect monitoring. Includes MacroDex (4.39M foods) & FitDex (1,356 exercises). Saturation Tracking Half-Life Curves AI Coach 24hr Free Trial Try Free for 24 Hours → Retrieved from \" https://wikipep.org/index.php?title=Pancreastatin&oldid=4033 \" Categories : Peptides Endogenous Peptides Metabolic Peptides Biomarkers Chromogranin A Derivatives Pancreastatin Add topic",
        "halfLife": "",
