          "IV (systemic) : 1.5-2.5 mg/kg/day (15,000-25,000 units/kg/day) divided every 12 hours Loading Dose : 2.0-2.5 mg/kg as single dose to rapidly achieve therapeutic levels (recommended by international guidelines) Intrathecal/Intraventricular : 50,000 units (5 mg) once daily Inhaled (nebulized) : 500,000 units (50 mg)",
