          "FDA-approved (Vyleesi, June 2019) for acquired, generalized HSDD in premenopausal women. Prescription-only. Off-label and research-chemical use (including in men) is outside the approved indication. An FDA-approved drug. Research-chemical 'PT-141' sold for other uses is separate from the approved Vyleesi product."
