          "Hepatic function (particularly important for MASH trials) Pancreatic enzymes Heart rate and cardiovascular parameters Blood glucose (especially in non-diabetic patients) Thyroid monitoring (GLP-1 class carries theoretical thyroid C-cell tumor risk; contraindicated in MEN2/family history of medullary thyroid carcinoma)."
