        "evidence": "Animal/cell evidence only Not a licensed UK medicine. The active fragment of Thymosin Beta-4, studied largely in preclinical animal models. Treated by WADA as prohibited; sold by some online retailers as 'research only'. Human evidence grade E, Theoretical / insufficient. Citation quality grade C, Limited human evidence.",
