        "evidence": "Animal/cell evidence only Not a licensed UK medicine. A multi-peptide thymic extract developed by the Russian Khavinson group; used clinically in Russia since the late 1970s. Independent Western replication is limited; UK access is research-only. Human evidence grade D, Animal/cell evidence only. Citation quality grade D, Animal/cell evidence only.",
