        "evidence": "Stock Solution: Dissolve in sterile water or PBS at 1-10 mM Working Concentrations: In vitro assays typically use 0.01-100 mcg/mL Storage: Aliquot and freeze at -20°C or -80°C Stability: Very short serum half-life (~30 seconds); use protease inhibitor cocktails for biological sample studies Rheumatoid Arthritis: Multiple controlled trials demonstrated improvement in disease activity scores, reduction in joint inflammation, and steroid-sparing effects Chronic Hepatitis B: Randomized controlled trials in China showed improved viral clearance rates and normalization of liver enzymes when combined with antiviral therapy HIV/AIDS: Early clinical trials showed improvements in CD4 counts and delayed disease progression, though results were modest compared to antiretroviral therapy Primary Immunodeficiency: Case series and small trials showing improved T-cell function and reduced infection rates Tumor Immunology: Enhancement of antitumor immune responses in syngeneic mouse tumor models Vaccine Adjuvant: Improved antibody and cellular immune responses when co-administered with vaccines",
