        "evidence": "Moderate human evidence Not a licensed UK medicine. Licensed in 35+ other countries (Zadaxin) for chronic hepatitis B/C and as an immune adjuvant. UK readers should not conflate 'approved elsewhere' with 'available on the NHS'. Sport status is uncertain - confirm before competition. Human evidence grade B, Moderate human evidence. Citation quality grade B, Moderate human evidence.",
