          "Published March 4, 2026 Updated September 6, 2026 Quick Brief Learn exactly how to reconstitute tirzepatide with BAC water, calculate your dose in insulin units, and store it safely. Includes concentration tables for 10mg, 20mg & 30mg vials.",
          "Lyophilization (freeze-drying) is how peptide manufacturers preserve tirzepatide for long-term stability. The powder form is shelf-stable, but it must be dissolved in a sterile liquid before injection.",
