          "The inhaled route showed minimal systemic side effects in pulmonary hypertension trials.",
          "VIPomas as a Caution VIPomas -- tumors that produce massive amounts of VIP -- cause severe watery diarrhea and dangerous electrolyte imbalances.",
          "Therapeutic doses are far lower, but this pathology illustrates the importance of appropriate dosing.",
