          "Mild mood shifts - thymic-CNS neuroimmune cross-regulation means thymic bioregulator activity occasionally produces subtle mood changes in some subjects during active cycle days; typically mild and transient.",
          "No serious adverse events documented in the Khavinson research literature at standard protocol doses - the thymic cytomedin safety profile across decades of Russian clinical use in elderly, immunosenescent populations is clean.",
